    <statement><p>Find a vector-parametric equation 
for the intersection of the paraboloids
<m>y = 3 x^2 + 7 z^2</m> and 
<m>y = 10 - 7 x^2 - 3 z^2</m>.</p>
<p>Intersection: <m>\vec{r}(t) =</m> 
<fillin characters="50" name="AnSwEr0001"/>
for <m>0 \leq t \leq 2\pi</m>.</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;\cos\mathopen{}\left(t\right),3\cos^{2}\mathopen{}\left(t\right)+7\sin^{2}\mathopen{}\left(t\right),\sin\mathopen{}\left(t\right)\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
